WEBVTT

00:00:00.358 --> 00:00:05.463
Boards and tasks — Every client project's tasks, reviews and questions — from backlog to done.

00:00:06.427 --> 00:00:12.936
Taskana is GALIL's task manager. Its pages are on the left: your Overview, Inbox, My work, the Board, all tasks, the Library and Insights.

00:00:13.585 --> 00:00:19.598
The Board shows the workflow, left to right: Backlog, To Do, Writing, Peer Review, SME Review and Done.

00:00:20.226 --> 00:00:27.236
Each card is a task: its key and type, the title, the project, the priority, the due date, comments and open questions — and who it's assigned to.

00:00:27.859 --> 00:00:34.867
Search, and filter by client, project, person, type or priority. Overdue and Open questions are one click; Save view keeps a filter in the sidebar.

00:00:35.586 --> 00:00:37.788
Let's create one. New task…

00:00:40.259 --> 00:00:46.123
Pick the project — projects, work orders and people all come from WorkDesk — and give it a title.

00:00:51.755 --> 00:00:56.108
Then the type, priority, who it's for, its status, dates and an estimate.

00:01:01.381 --> 00:01:04.184
Press Create. Eitan sees it in his Inbox and My work.

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:12.967
The task holds everything about the work: the description, a checklist, sub-tasks, linked tasks, files and links.

00:01:19.887 --> 00:01:26.905
On the right: status, assignee, dates and estimate — and the hours reported in WorkDesk on this task, against its estimate and the budget.

00:01:27.605 --> 00:01:32.709
Below, the comments. Mark one as a Question and it stays open until someone answers it.

00:01:43.533 --> 00:01:49.135
To move a task along, drag its card to the next column — or use its Move menu.

00:01:51.293 --> 00:01:56.158
It's in Writing now. Peer Review and SME Review are the review rounds before Done.

00:01:59.381 --> 00:02:03.890
My work: everything assigned to you, by due date — overdue first.

00:02:06.923 --> 00:02:12.440
The Inbox: new assignments, comments, questions for you and reviews waiting — the number shows what's unread.

00:02:13.121 --> 00:02:16.625
Employee Portal at the top takes you back to the home page.

00:02:17.329 --> 00:02:21.455
Plan · write · review · done — More help: the Handbook → Taskana.
